<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-17T14:45:01.516Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:45:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo, the founder of the Guadalajara cartel, died at age 80 in prison, ending the life of a key architect of Mexico's modern drug trade. In Jalisco and other states, Mexican army units are engaging in street shootouts while hunting cartel gangsters, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old girl. An ICE officer in Maine shot and killed an immigrant after expressing hatred of immigrants. Antonio Oseguera Cervantes, brother of Jalisco New Generation co-founder El Mencho, was sentenced to 22 years in a U.S. prison for a drug-trafficking plot. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPSW45dWs2QlRad09FcDI3Zl9Mc2wzM3hFYlFZa0toWEJiMzI1R3BSNmV0a1pIbHk0T1JBbDhQMnplbkl0RzB2OXpCVmdFdnYyd3YwN1VkWnY3ai1OTC1jZVExcG5xeXJjVC1vYjlnc054eG1xQkd6U1VnU0dDcG1MbzRKT21hVW56aURKdWJWU3E3OHQxUTVlMXNPYm9PQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQYVlNejIwYUFUcUU3aXY0Z0t4M0liVjZseGYzYUtlNjdzSXBiRVRfOGU4UGUtYlZwQkliYWNYRUlMWWt5cmU3Vm1HSHNpT1pWdTZiYW9uemZPY1phbVA1S2t5b3RCbUd4dzFGeDYtUjFxTXVnZURHX3ZBZWd5al92VG82V1M2TkxCSHhmaWJxZFBfY1lCM05yZXlkeERnV0tFYnY3aVg3Z2FkakttNmtWaDlKRFBrYUd2cEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNUFhCTTdINW50bVU4dFJuRi1fQWpvRXR5bHJ6LUF6bHV2MnVTaTc1MzRUbkdZbjhVRXE4Z1BWMnBOSTN0WGs0SzJ0MlAyVldZSjJ3ZHY4Z0lvTWc1elIwUi1hVzdwY1JwTGJpVFNRTjktWmZnemJVbjEwa0IzVEI4VzM1ckxUeHpHcDdOU29qaHhTSUZZY1hFZ01PT0x2bnpXZ1FKY1dqMFBLc1JmS1pYd3VnTzRoLWR2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &